approved 1.4/1.5 briefs, and the partial 1.4 branch `kg/rebuild-env@8d98ea8`
(read-only, not final). Reference oracle: `kg/reference-2026-09-29` at
`65f0eac5bb00b18a9d3acce319c2a231cbd5dff0`, `ops/bc-bootstrap-2026-09-29/`
{`prepare.py`, `select_replays.py`, `data-manifest.json`}. The reference is an oracle, not a source to copy.

